.nh
.TH "GHPM" "1" "Nov 2026" "ghpm 0.2.0-dev" "ghpm manual"

.SH NAME
ghpm-update - Install available updates


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBghpm update [id...] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks for updates, shows what will change, and installs the selected ones.
Pinned apps are skipped unless named explicitly.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	update every configured app, not only those known to be outdated

.PP
\fB--arch\fP=""
	target architecture (default: this machine)

.PP
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	replace files and symlinks not owned by ghpm

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for update

.PP
\fB--os\fP=""
	target operating system (default: this machine)

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	config file (default ~/.config/ghpm/config.yaml)

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	machine readable output (where supported)

.PP
\fB--no-cache\fP[=false]
	bypass the release metadata cache

.PP
\fB--proxy\fP=""
	HTTP(S) proxy URL, overrides config


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBghpm(1)\fP
